      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;objective&#34;&gt;Objective&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal of this lab was to enrol a Windows 10 device into Microsoft Intune and associate it with the correct user.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;environment&#34;&gt;Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Intune&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft 365 Business Premium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem&#34;&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The device appeared in Microsoft Entra ID, but it was not displayed correctly in Microsoft Intune.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;intune problem&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://aidenxieau.github.io/aiden-portfolio/labs/intune-device-registration/imgae/intune_problem.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;investigation&#34;&gt;Investigation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steps I checked:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;S1. The user&amp;rsquo;s Microsoft 365 licence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;check licence&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://aidenxieau.github.io/aiden-portfolio/labs/intune-device-registration/imgae/check_licence.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;S2. The device status in Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/p&gt;</description>
